# 🚀 HuffPress Pro - Ultimate Compression Engine

HuffPress Pro is a high-performance file compression and decompression software built in **Java Swing**. It leverages the core concepts of **Data Structures & Algorithms (DSA)** to shrink file weights efficiently.

## 🧠 Core Architecture & DSA Concepts
* **Greedy Approach (Huffman Coding):** Evaluates character token weights dynamically to synthesize optimal prefix-free variable-length binary trees.
* **Min-Heap (Priority Queue):** Drives the binary tree consolidation pipeline with an optimal runtime complexity of $O(N \log N)$.
* **Frequency Hashing (HashMap):** Tracks character payloads dynamically.
* **Bit Manipulation Logic:** Tight-packs string sequences of `0`s and `1`s directly into raw machine bytes.

## 🛠️ Features
* Custom Premium **Dark Theme Terminal GUI**
* Real-time **Animated JProgressBar** tracking operation states
* **Live Analytics Dashboard** displaying clock latencies and space deficit reduction metrics
